stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Issued: ForgotPassword<br/>INSERT token_hash, expires_at = now + 1h
    Issued --> Sent: email.Send (link with raw token)
    Sent --> Used: ResetPassword<br/>used_at = now
    Sent --> Expired: now > expires_at
    Issued --> Superseded: subsequent ForgotPassword<br/>UPDATE used_at on prior tokens
    Used --> [*]
    Expired --> [*]
    Superseded --> [*]
